380 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 838 0 R
/E (If an object is detected \(LOW signal\), the LED on pin 5 turns ON and the LED on pin 6 turns OFF. If no object is detected \(HIGH\), the LED on pin 5 turns OFF and the LED on pin 6 turns ON.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
