/Pg 25 0 R
/K [23]
>>
endobj
518 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 874 0 R
/E (The setup\(\) function runs once when the Arduino starts. It sets the IR sensor as INPUT and all LED pins as OUTPUT using pinMode\(\). Initially, all LEDs are turned OFF.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [24]
>>
endobj
519 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 875 0 R
/E (The loop\(\) function runs continuously. It reads the IR sensor value using digitalRead\(\) and compares it with the previous state stored in lastIRState.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [25]
>>
endobj
